{
  "$schema": "./_schema.json",
  "$comment": [
    "Sigil-ZS zero-shot graphs for vc::families::sigil_zs (P5-B): Sigil's export of Seed-VC seed-uvit-tat-xlsr-tiny (Plachtaa/seed-vc@51383efd; XLS-R-300M layer 12 from facebook/wav2vec2-xls-r-300m@1a640f32, the DiT from Plachta/Seed-VC@257283f9, CosyVoice-300M HiFT@24c40509, CAM++ campplus_cn_common) by scripts/vc-families/seed_vc/export.py, opset 17, weights inside each graph. The sha256 values are the graphs ADR 0006's reports measured (scripts/vc-families/reports/seed_vc_*.json, 'graphs').",
    "vc/zs-seed-vc holds every fp32 graph plus the fp16 HiFT decoder (hift_nsf.fp16 / hift.fp16, a switch); vc/zs-seed-vc-fp16 holds the optional fp16 XLS-R and DiT graphs (switches that fail waveform parity; ADR 0006). The bare estimator (dit.onnx) is not shipped: the step graphs run the update on the device.",
    "Entries start unpublished and become 'published' with scripts/models/publish-entries.mjs --write once their files are on the assets-v1 release (scripts/release/publish-assets.ps1); until then they are installed with the Models tab's Import or SIGIL_LOCAL_ASSETS (the export folder %LOCALAPPDATA%/sigil-dev-cache/vc-families/seed_vc is a valid local-assets folder: its file names are the in-entry paths; verified with `Sigil.exe --headless fetch vc/zs-seed-vc`). min_vram_mb is P5-B's measurement of one loaded voice (process VRAM delta, CUDA context included: CUDA 1358 MB, DirectML 1117 MB). Owned by P5-B."
  ],
